Third-party software
--------------------

Clear A11Y uses the third-party packages below. They are installed from npm
as dependencies, not copied into this repository, and remain under their own
licenses; each package's license file is in its npm tarball. Packages they
depend on in turn carry their own license files.

Two release artifacts redistribute third-party code:
- The GitHub Action bundle (action-v* branch and tags) inlines its JavaScript
  dependencies into dist/index.js, whose license comments are collected in
  dist/index.js.LEGAL.txt, and ships playwright-core unmodified (with its
  LICENSE, NOTICE and ThirdPartyNotices.txt) in dist/node_modules.
- The desktop app installers contain Electron, which includes Chromium and
  Node.js; Electron's bundled license files list their third-party notices.

